From: tobific <tobific@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] seam: cron per-job tier/no-fallback and memory isolation
 (experimental)

cron/scheduler_agent.py builds cron agents; jobs may carry service_tier
(normal|priority) and allow_fallbacks=false; cron agents run with
skip_memory=True and the memory toolset disabled. Optional for the
orchestrator (used by its cron effort tool).

Experimental, built against Hermes 8a3ede1b.
